    "implementation_rule": "Keep the two authentication components separate while reusing one Rust repository, response-error, tenant-context, and serialization layer.",
    "cutover_rule": "Do not delete a Python route until its complete component passes direct HTTP, persistence, gateway, and PostgreSQL differential gates."
  },
